  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Schrift X — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>At 3rd level, your technique has evolved and a cursed seal forms on your eye, providing near perfect accuracy. As an action for 3 cursed energy, you automatically hit a creature within range with a ranged weapon attack without rolling and deal an additional 2d6 necrotic damage. This increases to 3d6 at 6th level, 5d6 at 11th level, and 7d6 at 18th level.<br />\nYou can use this technique only if you haven't moved this turn, and after you use it, your speed is 0 until the end of the current turn.</p>",
